msgid "Flowchart for the structural optimization at finite temperatures"
msgstr "有限温度での構造最適化のフローチャート"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:112
msgid ""
"Options of the finite-temperature calculations, and how to use their results "
"in later calculations."
msgstr "有限温度の計算のオプションと、その結果を後の計算で使う方法。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:114
msgid ""
"``RELAX_STR`` selects what is relaxed at each temperature: nothing, the "
"atomic positions, or the atomic positions and the cell."
msgstr "``RELAX_STR`` で、各温度で何を最適化するか (何もしない、原子位置のみ、原子位置とセル) を選びます。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:115
msgid ""
"Relaxing the cell also needs the elastic constants and the coupling between "
"strain and forces. They come from DFT calculations of strained cells, "
"prepared with the :ref:`strain tools <label_strain_tools>` and given as "
"``STRAINFILE``. For high-symmetry crystals, ``STRAIN_COUPLING = 0`` estimates"
" them from the force constants instead."
msgstr ""
"セルを最適化するには、弾性定数と、ひずみと力の結合も必要です。これらはひずみを与えたセルの DFT 計算から :ref:`ひずみツール "
"<label_strain_tools>` で作成し、``STRAINFILE`` として与えます。高対称な結晶では、代わりに "
"``STRAIN_COUPLING = 0`` で力定数から推定することもできます。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:118
msgid ""
"The results at every temperature are stored in ``PREFIX``.scph.h5 or "
"``PREFIX``.qha.h5. To use them in a later ``MODE = kappa`` or ``phonons`` "
"calculation, set ``FC2_TEMPERATURE``, and also ``RELAXED_STRUCTURE = 1`` if "
"the structure was relaxed."
msgstr ""
"各温度の結果は ``PREFIX``.scph.h5 または ``PREFIX``.qha.h5 に保存されます。後の ``MODE = kappa`` "
"や ``phonons`` の計算で用いるには ``FC2_TEMPERATURE`` を指定し、構造を最適化した場合は "
"``RELAXED_STRUCTURE = 1`` も指定します。"

